### Create POC
POST http://localhost:5000/poc_service/add_pocs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "POC 1",
  "description": "Proof of Concept"
}

### Get All POCs
GET http://localhost:5000/poc_service

### Get POC by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/poc_service/{poc_id}

### Update POC
PUT http://localhost:5000/poc_service/{poc_id}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated POC",
  "description": "Updated Proof of Concept"
}

### Delete POC
DELETE http://localhost:5000/poc_service/{poc_id}

